      "content": "thanks. i think i forgot the resource part. wait, i see what i did. i put the bucket arn but the lambda is trying to write objects *into* the bucket, so i probably need to add the wildcard to the resource string, right? something like \"arn:aws:s3:::my-log-bucket/*\"?\n\nalso i checked the lambda execution role and it has the policy, but it's still failing. could it be a bucket policy issue on the S3 side itself blocking it?",
