      "content": "yeah im looking at it now. there isnt actually a bucket policy at all, it's just an empty policy block. \n\nis it possible there is some kind of service control policy (SCP) or something at the account level that's acting like a guardrail and just saying no to everything? it feels like there's a hidden wall or something blocking the connection even though everything i've configured looks open.",
